{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44921","headline":"送姚明府赴招义县 · 无可","name":"送姚明府赴招义县","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"濠梁古县城，结束赴王程。\n道路携家去，波涛隔月行。\n车临芳草下，吏踏落花迎。\n暮郭山遥见，春洲鸟不惊。\n风烟谯国远，桑柘楚田平。\n何以书能化，长淮彻海清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}